  "compare": [
    {
      "words": "scene, scenery, sight, view",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "c1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "scene"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 指一个景色或场景，包括人或动作；指舞台某个场面或部分布景；也指实际生活等中的场面。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "This is a "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "scene"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " of children playing in the garden. 这是孩子们在公园里玩耍的情景。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "scenery"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 指一个地区的整个自然景色；也指舞台的全部布景或整个场面。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The natural "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "scenery"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " of China is beautiful. 中国的自然景色美不胜收。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "sight"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 指值得看的或壮观的景象，也可指视力、视域等。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "The setting of the sun is a beautiful "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "sight"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": ". 日落是一幅多美的景象。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "Turning right, I caught "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "sight"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " of a snack bar. 右转，我看到了一家快餐店。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "strong",
              "v": "view"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " 强调从某一角度被观察到的景色或景观。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": "You can get a good "
            },
            {
              "t": "underline",
              "v": "view"
            },
            {
              "t": "text",
              "v": " from the room on the top floor of the hotel. 从酒店顶楼的房间看出去风景很美。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
